  "headline": "Prabowo Targets School Renovation Plan To Support Sekolah Rakyat",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Targets School Renovation Plan To Support Sekolah…",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto aims to renovate 200,000 schools over two years as the government integrates support services within the Sekolah Rakyat program.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto aims to renovate 200,000 schools by 2028 to complete nationwide repairs by 2029.",
    "The Ministry of Social Affairs and the BKKBN signed a memorandum to provide youth counseling and mental health services at Sekolah Rakyat.",
    "Regional administrations like Humbang Hasundutan are preparing land to host new facilities for the Sekolah Rakyat program."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has announced an infrastructure goal to renovate 100,000 schools annually throughout 2027 and 2028, aiming to address the condition of facilities nationwide by 2029. This initiative complements the ongoing Sekolah Rakyat program, which is designed to alleviate poverty and assist out-of-school youth. The government is strengthening the program's framework by deploying foster parents and dormitory supervisors who are tasked with providing empathy-led support. Furthermore, a partnership between the Ministry of Social Affairs and the Ministry of Population and Family Development has been established to introduce Adolescent Information and Counseling Centers. These centers aim to improve the mental well-being of students within the system. As the national initiative expands, local governments, such as those in Humbang Hasundutan, are proposing new sites and allocating land to accommodate the growing infrastructure needs of the Sekolah Rakyat model.",
